{"kind":"html","caption":"用递归为每个节点维护一个严格的取值区间 (下界, 上界)，左子树收紧上界，右子树抬高下界。示例 1 的所有节点都落在各自区间内，因此返回 true；示例 2 中节点 4 虽小于父节点 5，却不满足根节点右子树要求的 (5, +∞)，因此返回 false。区间必须使用长整型边界，才能覆盖值恰为 32 位整数极值的节点。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>验证二叉搜索树</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.muted{color:#8d8d8d}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.array,.chars,.row-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell,.char,.num-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.3s}\n.cell .idx,.char .index,.index,.marker{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400}\n.cell.active,.cell.mid,.cell.current,.cell.found,.cell.max,.char.active,.num-cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.out,.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.card{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30}\n.card-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.card-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot,.pill{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;transition:background .3s}\n.dot.on,.pill.on{background:#3794ff}\n.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.pills .pill{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pills .pill.active,.pills .pill.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n\n.stage{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.stage{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.card h2{font-size:13px;margin:0 0 6px;font-weight:600}\n.input{font-size:11px;color:#3794ff;margin-bottom:6px;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.tree{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}\n.tree-row{display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.node{padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30;text-align:center;min-width:56px}\n.node .value{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;display:block;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.node .label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.node.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.node.ok{border-color:#4ec9b0}\n.node.bad{border-color:#f14c4c;background:#5a1d1d}\n.branch-labels{display:flex;gap:6px;justify-content:center;font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d}\n.status{min-height:auto;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#1c1c1c;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.step-no{color:#3794ff;font-weight:700;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.range{display:inline-block;margin-top:4px;padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;font-size:11px;color:#ce9178;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.verdict{padding:6px 8px;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;background:#2d2d30}\n.verdict.true{background:#176b55;color:#fff}\n.verdict.false{background:#8b2424;color:#fff}\n.progress .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex:none}\n.legend{font-size:11px;line-height:1.45;margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px}\n\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>BST：传递严格区间</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">蓝=访问中 · 绿=通过 · 红=越界</p>\n<div class=\"rule\">须满足 <span class=\"mono\">下界 &lt; value &lt; 上界</span>；左子树收紧上界，右子树抬高下界。</div>\n<section class=\"stage\">\n<div class=\"card panel\"><h2 id=\"exampleTitle\">示例 1</h2><div class=\"input\" id=\"inputText\">root = [2,1,3]</div><div class=\"tree\" id=\"treeBox\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"card panel\"><h2>递归检查</h2><div class=\"status\" id=\"status\"></div><div class=\"verdict waiting\" id=\"verdict\">等待完成检查</div><div class=\"progress\" id=\"progress\"></div></div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"legend\">不能只比父子；示例 2 中 4 违反根右子树全局下界 5。</div>\n</main>\n<script>\n\nconst examples = [\n  {\n    title: '示例 1', input: 'root = [2,1,3]', result: true,\n    nodes: [\n      { id: 'a2', value: '2', label: '根节点' },\n      { id: 'a1', value: '1', label: '左子节点' },\n      { id: 'a3', value: '3', label: '右子节点' }\n    ],\n    steps: [\n      { id: 'a2', text: '访问根节点 2', range: '(-∞, +∞)', state: 'active' },\n      { id: 'a1', text: '进入左子树，访问节点 1', range: '(-∞, 2)', state: 'active', done: ['a2'] },\n      { id: 'a3', text: '进入右子树，访问节点 3', range: '(2, +∞)', state: 'active', done: ['a2','a1'] },\n      { text: '所有节点都满足严格区间', range: '检查完成', done: ['a2','a1','a3'], finish: true }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    title: '示例 2', input: 'root = [5,1,4,null,null,3,6]', result: false,\n    nodes: [\n      { id: 'b5', value: '5', label: '根节点' },\n      { id: 'b1', value: '1', label: '左子节点' },\n      { id: 'b4', value: '4', label: '右子节点' },\n      { id: 'b3', value: '3', label: '节点 4 的左子节点' },\n      { id: 'b6', value: '6', label: '节点 4 的右子节点' }\n    ],\n    steps: [\n      { id: 'b5', text: '访问根节点 5', range: '(-∞, +∞)', state: 'active' },\n      { id: 'b1', text: '进入左子树，节点 1 合法', range: '(-∞, 5)', state: 'active', done: ['b5'] },\n      { id: 'b4', text: '进入根节点的右子树，访问节点 4', range: '(5, +∞)', state: 'bad', done: ['b5','b1'] },\n      { id: 'b4', text: '4 不大于下界 5，立即判定无效', range: '要求：5 < 4 < +∞（不成立）', state: 'bad', done: ['b5','b1'], finish: true }\n    ]\n  }\n];\n\nlet exampleIndex = 0;\nlet stepIndex = 0;\n\nfunction renderTree(ex) {\n  const box = document.getElementById('treeBox');\n  const node = n => `<div class=\"node\" id=\"${n.id}\"><span class=\"value\">${n.value}</span><span class=\"label\">${n.label}</span></div>`;\n  if (exampleIndex === 0) {\n    box.innerHTML = `<div class=\"tree-row one\">${node(ex.nodes[0])}</div><div class=\"branch-labels\"><span>↙ 左：更小</span><span>右：更大 ↘</span></div><div class=\"tree-row two\">${node(ex.nodes[1])}${node(ex.nodes[2])}</div>`;\n  } else {\n    box.innerHTML = `<div class=\"tree-row one\">${node(ex.nodes[0])}</div><div class=\"branch-labels\"><span>↙ 左：更小</span><span>右：更大 ↘</span></div><div class=\"tree-row two\">${node(ex.nodes[1])}${node(ex.nodes[2])}</div><div class=\"branch-labels\"><span>节点 1 无子节点</span><span>节点 4 的两个子节点 ↓</span></div><div class=\"tree-row two\">${node(ex.nodes[3])}${node(ex.nodes[4])}</div>`;\n  }\n}\n\nfunction renderExample() {\n  const ex = examples[exampleIndex];\n  document.getElementById('exampleTitle').textContent = ex.title;\n  document.getElementById('inputText').textContent = ex.input;\n  renderTree(ex);\n  const progress = document.getElementById('progress');\n  progress.innerHTML = ex.steps.map((_, i) => `<span class=\"dot\" data-step=\"${i}\"></span>`).join('');\n  document.getElementById('verdict').className = 'verdict waiting';\n  document.getElementById('verdict').textContent = '等待完成检查';\n}\n\nfunction showStep() {\n  const ex = examples[exampleIndex];\n  const step = ex.steps[stepIndex];\n  document.querySelectorAll('.node').forEach(n => n.className = 'node');\n  (step.done || []).forEach(id => {\n    const el = document.getElementById(id);\n    if (el) el.classList.add('ok');\n  });\n  if (step.id) {\n    const el = document.getElementById(step.id);\n    if (el) el.classList.add(step.state || 'active');\n  }\n  document.getElementById('status').innerHTML = `<span class=\"step-no\">步骤 ${stepIndex + 1} / ${ex.steps.length}</span><br>${step.text}<br><span class=\"range\">允许范围 ${step.range}</span>`;\n  document.querySelectorAll('.dot').forEach((dot, i) => dot.classList.toggle('on', i <= stepIndex));\n  if (step.finish) {\n    const verdict = document.getElementById('verdict');\n    verdict.className = `verdict ${ex.result ? 'true' : 'false'}`;\n    verdict.textContent = ex.result ? '输出：true' : '输出：false';\n  }\n}\n\nfunction advance() {\n  const ex = examples[exampleIndex];\n  stepIndex++;\n  if (stepIndex >= ex.steps.length) {\n    exampleIndex = (exampleIndex + 1) % examples.length;\n    stepIndex = 0;\n    renderExample();\n  }\n  showStep();\n}\n\nrenderExample();\nshowStep();\nsetInterval(advance, 1900);\n\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
